The hwemoji package provides Unicode emoji support for pdfLaTeX,
including support for emoji sequences.

See hwemoji.pdf for more details.

The package requires:
    hwemoji.sty
        Source file
    hwemoji-assets.pdf
        Graphics file containing all supported emojis